 "lyrics": [
  {
   "start": 13.68,
   "end": 17.84,
   "text": "Someday you'll come back here"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.6,
   "end": 22.72,
   "text": "And you'll open up your arms"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.68,
   "end": 31.2,
   "text": "And you'll laugh and say I knew it wouldn't take you long"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.92,
   "end": 35.28,
   "text": "To realize I was gone"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.6,
   "end": 41.6,
   "text": "And it's only been three years"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.68,
   "end": 47.2,
   "text": "But to me it's been so long"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.52,
   "end": 53.2,
   "text": "And I remember it like yesterday"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.44,
   "end": 58.4,
   "text": "Oh you could say I've been holding on"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.08,
   "end": 64.48,
   "text": "And I waited all of my life"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.8,
   "end": 67.2,
   "text": "For you to make it right"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.52,
   "end": 71.2,
   "text": "But the time has come and gone"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.08,
   "end": 76.4,
   "text": "And it faded and lost all its light"
  },
  {
   "start": 76.8,
   "end": 82.8,
   "text": "A star that shined so bright falls from the sky"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.0,
   "end": 88.0,
   "text": "Don't make a wish that won't come true"
  },
  {
   "start": 88.48,
   "end": 94.4,
   "text": "And I learned that from you such a long time ago"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.92,
   "end": 100.0,
   "text": "When you left you said you had to find"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.64,
   "end": 106.4,
   "text": "A better way of life, this one just wouldn't do"
  },
  {
   "start": 107.92,
   "end": 112.24,
   "text": "And I waited all of my life"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.72,
   "end": 115.2,
   "text": "For you to take your time"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.68,
   "end": 119.2,
   "text": "To find your place"
  },
  {
   "start": 120.0,
   "end": 124.64,
   "text": "But I learned that this world still turns without you and you were just a phase"
  },
  {
   "start": 124.64,
   "end": 133.28,
   "text": "And I learned without you here I was happier alone than I ever would have known"
  },
  {
   "start": 156.0,
   "end": 158.0,
   "text": "And I waited"
  },
  {
   "start": 162.0,
   "end": 164.0,
   "text": "And I waited"
